    "body": "This is a part 2 of #34778 (part 1 - #41075). It documents the shape of `manifest.dependencies` and uses it in `:checkhealth vim.pack` to report problems with dependencies. There are also two minor improvements to `:che vim.pack`.\r\n\r\nThe plan is to reach an agreement about the `manifest.dependency` shape, merge this (as this is rather low risk), and re-evaluate if it is reasonable to attempt part 3 (use `manifest.dependencies` to compute `deps` field of the lockfile to improve installation/loading order) before the 0.13 release.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHere is a sample of how `:che vim.pack` output for not fully conforming setup:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2880\" height=\"1734\" alt=\"screenshot_2026-09-12_15:36:19\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4336842-3886-428a-8f2d-db98081777ae\" />",
